# tests.txt — projection05.12 (0507.prime-support 05.12, fixture state projection)

Commands:
- python -B [-X dev] labs/state-projection-pass01/tests/test_state_projection.py -v
- python -B [-X dev] labs/state-projection-pass01/demo.py
- python -B scratchpad/d0512/mutate.py
Python 3.14.7, Windows. Every run is kept. The first run passed, so there are no failure transcripts; the mutation checks show the tests can fail. There are no skips.
Custody fixtures use the real pinned return_capture.py (reserve, capture) and return_inspect.py on disposable books. Test_15 alone replaces the inspector's stdout in-process, to exercise malformed reports.
No model was called. Fixture data only.

